" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="io.legado.flutter_legado" content-desc="　　因为在来学院之间那段时间的&#10;锻炼，在身体力量上他有了不小的&#10;进步，此时也勉强能够握住锤子不&#10;感觉到太大的负荷了。" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1182][1017,1590]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="11" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="io.legado.flutter_legado" content-desc="　　大师眼中激动的光芒渐渐淡化&#10;，“你爸爸是做什么的？”" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1380][1017,1584]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="12" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="io.legado.flutter_legado" content-desc="　　大师眼中激动的光芒渐渐淡化&#10;，“你爸爸是做什么的？”" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1380][1017,1584]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="13" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="io.legado.flutter_legado" content-desc="　　唐三道：“是村里的铁匠。”" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1590][889,1692]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="14" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="io.legado.flutter_legado" content-desc="　　唐三道：“是村里的铁匠。”" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="true" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1590][889,1692]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>